  "journal": {
    "missing_expedition": {
      "title": "The Missing Expedition",
      "text": "Tents, cold fires and supplies that haven't been out here long, and nobody. Their journal shows they were mapping the same markings we found, with a sketch of the six-pointed shape; the last page is gone. A lantern lay smashed by the cliff, part of their map has been rubbed out, and tracks lead toward the trees. Then the ground hummed, the lantern rolled along the table with no wind, and the compass woke. It led to a stone post carved with a woodland emblem. Elara says it is Sylvaris."
    }
